+                <t indent="0" pn="section-3.2.1.1-3.22.1">The client OPTIONALLY supplies this attribute.  The Printer
+object OPTIONALLY supports this attribute and the
+&quot;job-impressions-supported&quot; attribute (see section 4.4.31).  The
+client supplied &quot;job-impressions&quot; operation attribute identifies
+the total size in number of impressions of the document(s) being
+submitted (see section 4.3.18 for the complete semantics).</t>
+                <t indent="0" pn="section-3.2.1.1-3.22.2">See note under &quot;job-k-octets&quot;.</t>
+              </dd>
